5919c6b47ff9410f8c49fe304973.webp?t=1741095764\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with up to 20 computer opponents on huge procedurally generated maps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sabotage your opponents or make agreements to prevent sabotage acts against your transport routes. Cooperate with them to provide cities as quickly as possible or buy unpleasant competitors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/26b6cd52e66552420ea6c65538a4edd8.poster.avif?t=1741095764\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/26b6cd52e66552420ea6c65538a4edd8.webm?t=1741095764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/26b6cd52e66552420ea6c65538a4edd8.mp4?t=1741095764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/81f47cb7d58b677ea5321bb14a319f33.webp?t=1741095764\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage the power supply for cities and industries by delivering the required goods to power plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/d20af0a3ae5f85211846643e703ab46b.avif?t=1741095764\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/dbfced5189f77ff95eb112c16ed8f0bc.webp?t=1741095764\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help cities grow by satisfying their needs for goods, food and luxury goods. Big cities provide more passengers which can be transported to nearby cities profitably. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/462486ccf675170d057284d655c238a9.poster.avif?t=1741095764\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/462486ccf675170d057284d655c238a9.webm?t=1741095764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/462486ccf675170d057284d655c238a9.mp4?t=1741095764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/09f554b10e11b442506316363dd8eefd.webp?t=1741095764\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transport 40 different goods between 39 different industries and numerous cities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your station stock low to get a production bonus from industry buildings. Deliver machinery and tools to industry buildings to get a production boost for a short period of time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/043b390b50a8134c8fd50a1411505034.poster.avif?t=1741095764\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/043b390b50a8134c8fd50a1411505034.webm?t=1741095764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/043b390b50a8134c8fd50a1411505034.mp4?t=1741095764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
